OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool man breaks 200-mile race
OL,4,Arecord
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool electrician who took up
OL,7,Frunning when gyms closed during the
OL,8,Fcoronavirus pandemic has broken the
OL,9,Fcourse record for a 203-mile (327km)
OL,10,Frace in the US.
OL,12,FAndrew Kelly, 29, from Allerton, won
OL,13,Fthe Buckeye 200 in Ohio in 50 hours, 10
OL,14,Fminutes and five seconds, race
OL,15,Forganisers said.
OL,17,FCompetitors had six days to complete
OL,18,Fthe course, but Kelly beat the previous
OL,19,Frecord, set in 2023, by almost four
OL,20,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
